            "storage": "wp_posts",
            "record_id": 5,
            "post_id": 5,
            "value": "<h3>Thanks to everyone for getting their picks in. This will go much smoother for Segment 2 when you all enter your own picks !\r\nBelow is a link to the Team Chart for Segment 1. Take a look and make sure your picks are correct. Let me know if you need any corrections.</h3>\r\n<h3><a href=\"http://manliusracingleague.com/2017_S1_Team_chart.php\" target=\"_blank\">2017_S1_Team_chart.php</a></h3>\r\n<h3>On behalf of Jeff and myself, good luck to all !201\r\n-- Steve</h3>",
            "sha256": "39403364b06209f31c6b48a4b3b7ef600d1a8600a8be86719f32720ae3be337f"
        },
        {
            "storage": "wp_posts",
            "record_id": 172,
            "post_id": 172,
            "value": "<h4>Please note \u2013 after the update went out, we were notified of an error (on entry, not selection) in one of the team picks - this change resulted in no change in position for any team.</h4>\r\n<h4>Here is the revised <a href=\"http://manliusracingleague.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/Week-1-Update-Rev_A.pdf\">Week 1 Update</a></h4>\r\n<h4>And here is the updated <a href=\"http://manliusracingleague.com/2017_S1_Team_chart.php\" target=\"_blank\">Segment 1 Team Chart</a>.</h4>",
            "sha256": "1cbe5232fde23fc684a56436807801afc3cc878e07c5d60537ddfa09215338ff"
        },
        {
            "storage": "wp_posts",
