            "post_id": 640,
            "value": "<h4>Here is the <a href=\"http://manliusracingleague.com/2017_S3_Team_chart.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Team Chart</a>\u00a0for segment 3 !</h4>\r\n<h4>Thanks for getting your picks in ! \u00a0<del>Still missing picks from\u00a0Over The Edge (Reid Strickland).</del></h4>\r\n<h4>Good luck to all !</h4>",
