        {
            "storage": "wp_posts",
            "record_id": 783,
            "post_id": 783,
            "value": "Here is the <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"http://manliusracingleague.com/2017_S4_Team_chart.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Team Chart</a></span>\u00a0for the Playoffs (Segment 4) !\r\n\r\nThanks for getting your picks in !\u00a0 Please check to make sure they are correct.\r\n\r\nStill missing picks from\u00a0Redneck Racing (Jody Jones) and Jimmy's Johnson (Trevor MacPherson). Those teams will receive ZERO point for this weeks race, and subsequent races until their picks are received.\r\n\r\nGood luck to all !",
            "sha256": "d0f13226b8d97985e414ef27f589ceaf698501611975f95fae722d51d6d95a5a"
        },
        {
            "storage": "wp_posts",
            "record_id": 920,
            "post_id": 920,
            "value": "Here's the latest .... All picks received have been entered into the database...\r\nPlease login and confirm your picks -&gt;\u00a0<a href=\"https://manliusracingleague.com/team.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Login here</a>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Missing picks from:</span>\r\n\r\nCalvin Hickling\r\nJohn Deecher\r\nJody Jones\r\nJoe Massey\r\n\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Not returning this year:</span>\r\n\r\nRhonda Catanzaro\r\nDenise Rieck\r\nTrevor MacPherson\r\n\r\nHere is the preliminary\u00a0<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://manliusracingleague.com/2018_S1_Team_chart.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Team Chart</a></span>\u00a0(no picks shown) for Segment 1 of 2018 ...\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;",
            "sha256": "a3256cc1648ce7c60d4dd8671226117fe8cea51992f1655a9c7138fcf1811016"
        },
        {
            "storage": "wp_posts",
            "record_id": 925,
            "post_id": 925,
            "value": "OK, here we go !\u00a0 2018 season is less than a couple of hours away....\r\n\r\nHere's the team chart for Segment 1 ... we're down a few, and haven't heard from a couple (contact Jeff if you still want to get in this year).\r\n\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://manliusracingleague.com/2018_S1_Team_chart.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">2018 S1 Team chart</a></span>\r\n\r\nPlease check your teams for to make sure they are correct to what you submitted.\r\n\r\nGood luck to all !",
            "sha256": "7687ceef1e31ae2245c52f1ba3fca465574d33a669aa635b218be616b1d63f03"
        },
        {
            "storage": "wp_posts",
            "record_id": 1026,
            "post_id": 1026,
            "value": "OK, here we go !\u00a0 <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://manliusracingleague.com/2018_S2_Team_chart.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">2018 segment 2</a></span> is about to begin.\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s the team chart\u2026 still missing a team or 2. So check the list and let me know. I've entered everything I have.\r\n\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://manliusracingleague.com/2018_S2_Team_chart.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">2018 S2 Team chart</a></span>\r\n\r\nPlease check your teams for to make sure they are correct to what you submitted.\r\n\r\nGood luck to all !\r\n\r\n* edit: corrected link , was segment 1",
            "sha256": "537a19a3fec6a4431b8682f171af7d0345b5f3716e30d9471ed7a6bad50b8e99"
        },
        {
            "storage": "wp_posts",
            "record_id": 1049,
            "post_id": 1049,
            "value": "I've been made aware of issues opening the team chart ... I'm working to get to the bottom of it , but in the meantime, here is a new link , a pdf, and a jpg file that you should be able to open.\r\n\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a class=\"row-title\" href=\"http://manliusracingleague.com/2018_S2_Team_chart.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"\u201c2018 Segment 2\u201d (Edit)\">2018 Segment 2 team chart (in browser)</a></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"http://manliusracingleague.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/2018_S2_Team_chart.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">2018_S2_Team_chart (pdf)</a></span>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://manliusracingleague.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/2018_S2_Team_chart.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1051 size-medium\" src=\"http://manliusracingleague.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/2018_S2_Team_chart-300x253.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"253\" /></a>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;",
            "sha256": "036bdb3df70b02436305a53a1606862b3bd09598071585a2dd22e4ce9b2ea09d"
        },
        {
            "storage": "wp_posts",
            "record_id": 1152,
            "post_id": 1152,
            "value": "A couple of items to note prior to starting Segment 3...\u00a0<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<strong>1</strong> - Thanks to everyone for getting their picks in. Even with the holiday, this went much smoother than prior segments !\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s the team chart for <a href=\"https://manliusracingleague.com/2018_S3_Team_chart.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Segment 3</span></a> (Webpage)\r\n\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"http://manliusracingleague.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/2018_S3_Team_chart.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">2018_S3_Team_chart</a></span>\u00a0(pdf)\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://manliusracingleague.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/2018_S3_Team_chart.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">2018_S3_Team_chart</span></a> (jpg)\r\n\r\nPlease check your teams for to make sure they are correct to what you submitted.\r\n\r\nGood luck to all !\r\n\r\n<strong>2</strong> - You should have noticed a new look to the website ... trying out a new template, let me know your <a href=\"mailto:ManliusRacingLeague@gmail.com?subject=Website changes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">thoughts</span></a>.\r\n\r\nThanks, Steve\r\n\r\n&nbsp;",
            "sha256": "a852a8b3f009c88aad9fd8f505f38e02940e0eeddbfc1b2b6538d4736e6e4816"
        },
